[6] VARIASI ARENA & PILIHAN LUAS LAPANGAN (PITCH SIZE)
======================================================================================

  A. 3 Pilihan Arena
  +-----------------+------------------+---------------+-----------------------------+
  | Nama Arena      | Dimensi & Gawang | Pantulan (e)  | Karakteristik Khusus        |
  +-----------------+------------------+---------------+-----------------------------+
  | CLASSIC STADIUM | Lebar standar    | 0.89          | Rumput hijau seimbang,      |
  |                 | Gawang: 58 px    | (Seimbang)    | ideal untuk semua gaya.     |
  +-----------------+------------------+---------------+-----------------------------+
  | CONCRETE ALLEY  | Lebih sempit     | 0.96          | Lapangan gang aspal beton,  |
  |                 | Gawang: 52 px    | (Sangat Keras)| cocok main bank shot cepat. |
  +-----------------+------------------+---------------+-----------------------------+
  | ROOFTOP NIGHT   | Standar atap     | 0.90          | Latar malam + ANGIN SAMPING |
  |                 | Gawang: 58 px    | (Menengah)    | yang membelokkan bola!      |
  +-----------------+------------------+---------------+-----------------------------+

  B. 3 Pilihan Luas Lapangan (Menu: PITCH SIZE) - Berlaku di Semua Mode!
